%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Noto Sans CJK SC, PingFang SC, sans-serif"}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Send["数据包已发送；<br/>加入 sk_write_queue"]
    Track["packets_out++<br/>tcp_clock_stamp"]

    Wait["等待 ACK"]
    Ack{"收到 ACK？"}
    Done["正常：清除重传状态，推进 snd_una"]

    Tick["RTO 定时器触发<br/>（或触发快速重传）"]
    Detect{"3 个 dup ACK 或<br/>RACK 判定乱序？"}
    Recover["进入 Recovery<br/>将 cwnd 减半，设置 ssthresh"]
    Retx["重传丢失的报文段"]
    Newack["新 ACK 清除 Recovery 状态"]

    Send --> Track --> Wait --> Ack
    Ack -->|是| Done
    Ack -->|否，超时| Tick --> Retx
    Ack -->|dup ACK| Detect
    Detect -->|是| Recover --> Retx --> Newack

    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Tick,Recover,Retx bad
    class Done,Newack ok
